<%- include('partials/head', { title, description }) %>
<%- include('partials/nav', { clinic }) %>

<main id="main">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <p class="section-label">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-dark">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString(undefined, { year: "numeric", month: "long", day: "numeric" }) %></p>

    <div class="prose-sm mt-8 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/90">
      <p>
        Zafoor Clinic ("we", "us", "the clinic") respects your privacy. This policy explains what information we
        collect when you use this website or book an appointment, and how we use it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-dark">Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you book an appointment through this website, we collect the information you provide directly:
        your name, phone number, email address (if given), age and gender (if given), the service you selected,
        and any reason for visit or notes you choose to share.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-dark">How we use your information</h2>
      <p>
        We use this information to create or update your patient record, schedule and manage your appointment,
        and contact you about your visit. Your information is stored in the clinic's patient management system
        and is accessible only to authorized clinic staff.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-dark">Medical information</h2>
      <p>
        Any medical information recorded during your consultation is kept as part of your confidential medical
        record and is never published or shared publicly. It is used solely to provide you care and, where
        legally required, for clinic record-keeping.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-dark">Data sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell or rent your personal information. We do not share your information with third parties
        except where necessary to provide your care or where required by law.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-dark">Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You may contact the clinic at any time to ask what information we hold about you, to request a
        correction, or to ask questions about how your information is used.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-dark">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy questions, contact us at <a class="text-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:<%= clinic.email %>"><%= clinic.email %></a>
        or call <a class="text-primary hover:underline" href="tel:<%= clinic.phone %>"><%= clinic.phone %></a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer', { clinic }) %>
